{"id":4928820,"shortDescription":"Shelve the Potions! te pone al frente de una tienda de pociones sumida en el caos. Los gatos han tirado todo al suelo y tendrás que devolver más de 2.000 pociones a su sitio. Sigue las pistas, descifra símbolos y encuentra notas en este acogedor y relajante juego de puzles y organización.","developers":["Knight Owl Games"],"publishers":["Knight Owl Games"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Comodidad de la cámara","Alternativas de color","Controles de volumen personalizados","#category_playable_at_your_own_pace","Jugable sin restricciones de tiempo","Guardar en cualquier momento","Opciones de subtítulos","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"24 AGO 2026","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928820/beff2f8cc0acec9ea14dbb1410251dcef1c7233f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1794400461","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928820/0f0b8a4403f83e1f9aaa3b5e61f654d04d462df6/ss_0f0b8a4403f83e1f9aaa3b5e61f654d04d462df6.600x338.jpg?t=1794400461","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928820/0f0b8a4403f83e1f9aaa3b5e61f654d04d462df6/ss_0f0b8a4403f83e1f9aaa3b5e61f654d04d462df6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794400461"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928820/76310d45b057f3e1f0c60238eddd3fba77a467fb/ss_76310d45b057f3e1f0c60238eddd3fba77a467fb.600x338.jpg?t=1794400461","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928820/76310d45b057f3e1f0c60238eddd3fba77a467fb/ss_76310d45b057f3e1f0c60238eddd3fba77a467fb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1794400461"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928820/bdfa778179b7452fa9d4412b865860c155dd14e5/ss_bdfa778179b7452fa9d4412b865860c155dd14e5.600x338.jpg?t=1794400461","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928820/bdfa778179b